%% Sequence: POST /api/search with Ollama query expansion, LLM bulkhead and fallback
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client (CLI `search` / curl)
    participant L as Drogon event loop
    participant SC as SearchController
    participant SS as SearchService
    participant LP as llmPool (LLM_THREADS = 4)
    participant RP as requestPool (16)
    participant QE as QueryExpander
    participant OC as OllamaClient
    participant O as Ollama (qwen2.5:3b)
    participant SE as SearchEngine

    C->>L: POST /api/search {"query":"car","mode":"keyword","limit":10}
    L->>SC: handle(request), arrival = now
    SC->>SC: parseRequest(): query, mode (required), limit, expand
    alt validation error
        SC-->>C: 400 {"error":"invalid_query" | "invalid_mode" | ...}
    else index not built
        SC-->>C: 503 {"error":"index_not_ready"}
    end
    SC->>SS: route(expand)
    alt expand = false
        SS-->>SC: Plain -> requestPool
    else expand = true and llmPool queue < LLM_MAX_QUEUE
        SS-->>SC: Llm -> llmPool
    else llmPool queue is full
        SS-->>SC: Overloaded -> requestPool + immediate fallback
    end
    alt chosen pool holds MAX_PENDING_REQUESTS tasks
        SC-->>C: 503 {"error":"server_busy"}
    end
    SC->>LP: post(pipeline task)  (Plain/Overloaded go to RP instead)
    Note over L,RP: event loop is free, and searches without LLM never wait behind LLM searches
    LP->>SS: runPipeline(query, limit, expand, arrival)
    SS->>QE: expand(query, deadline = arrival + 30 s)
    QE->>OC: isAvailable() (cached, refreshed in background every 5 s)
    alt available and time budget left
        QE->>OC: generate(JSON prompt, remaining budget)
        OC->>O: POST /api/generate {"format":"json","stream":false}
        par parallel availability probe
            OC->>O: GET /api/tags
        end
        O-->>OC: {"response": "{expanded_terms: [...]}"}
        OC-->>QE: response text
        QE->>QE: parseResponse(): JSON, sanitize, dedupe, max 6 terms
        QE-->>SS: status = ok, expanded_terms
    else unavailable / budget spent / timeout / probe says down / invalid JSON
        QE-->>SS: status = fallback, fallback_reason
        Note over SS: logged as WARN, search continues
    end
    SS->>SE: search(buildQueryTerms(query, expanded, w = 0.5), limit)
    SE->>SE: shared locks, TF-IDF, partial_sort top-K, snippets
    SE-->>SS: SearchResponse
    SS-->>LP: PipelineResult (time_ms measured from arrival)
    LP-->>C: 200 {"results":[...],"time_ms":..,"expansion_status":"ok",...}
